
<div class="modal fade" id="search-help-modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="search-help-modal-title">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        </button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="search-help-modal-title">
          <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign" aria-hidden="true"></span> Search tips
        </h4>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>
          <strong>Partial words match automatically.</strong>
          For example, <code>metabol</code> already finds <em>metabolomics</em>, so you rarely need a <code>*</code>.
          Searches are not case-sensitive, accents are ignored (<code>Muller</code> finds <em>Müller</em>),
          and hyphens and spaces in names don't matter (<code>Thy1</code> finds <em>Thy-1</em>).
        </p>

        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table table-condensed">
            <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>To find…</th>
              <th>Type</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Items containing both words</td>
              <td><code>wnt AND signalling</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Items containing either word</td>
              <td><code>kinase OR phosphatase</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Items without a word</td>
              <td><code>cell NOT plant</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>A word that must / must not appear</td>
              <td><code>+kinase -yeast</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>An exact phrase</td>
              <td><code>"data file"</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Combined conditions</td>
              <td><code>(kinase OR phosphatase) AND assay</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Wildcards: <code>*</code> for any number of characters, <code>?</code> for exactly one</td>
              <td><code>*omics</code>, <code>d?tafile</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Similar spellings, allowing for typos</td>
              <td><code>charactaristic~</code></td>
            </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="help-block">
          <code>AND</code>, <code>OR</code> and <code>NOT</code> must be written in capital letters.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>